  "narrative": {
    "overview": "PayByPalm's incumbent identity combines royal blue, Inter typography, white cards, and a pale cool canvas. Clear amounts, familiar controls, and generous rounding give the customer wallet a calm, approachable financial interface.\n\nThis document records the implemented system in `wallet/src/index.css` and `wallet/src/components/ui.tsx`; it does not establish a replacement identity. Product constraints live in `PRODUCT.md`. Landing composition and illustration decisions live in `.impeccable/surfaces/landing.md`.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Royal blue actions and clear ink text.",
      "Softly rounded white surfaces on a cool canvas.",
      "Stable financial figures and visible keyboard focus."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Source Rule",
        "body": "Reuse the global CSS variables rather than sampling a route illustration. The welcome route scopes its own blue (`#2851c5`) and deep blue (`#1a3a9e`); these do not replace the global accent. Some existing navigation details also use the darker blue locally.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Stable Figures Rule",
        "body": "Use tabular numerals (`font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-feature-settings: 'tnum' 1`) for naira amounts and other changing figures. Preserve the shared bold Wordmark, including its quieter \u201cBy\u201d, and the existing PalmIcon SVG.",
